NOSCHEDULE
# Always on - clears both Witty Pi alarms and leaves them clear.
# The device never power-cycles itself; uptime is kept in check by the
# connector's software high-uptime reboot (nightly once uptime > 24.5h),
# which shows on the dashboard as "high uptime reboot".
# For 24h-critical cameras where relying on Witty Pi alarms is a risk.
